## Compatibility changes

`queryCorrectionOffset` request 308 maps to
`MQClientApi::query_correction_offset`; its Java fixture covers nullable
inputs, filtered group strings, response body and broker error behavior.
`updateAndGetGroupForbidden` request 353 maps to
`MQClientApi::update_and_get_group_forbidden`; its request header and nullable
`GroupForbidden` response DTO are fixture-backed. `GroupForbidden` also matches
the pinned Java getters, setters, value equality, `hashCode`, and `toString`.
The API audit now marks these two operations closed and lists 16 remaining
direct API gaps.

